<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Algorithm Summary</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Algorithm <a href="#alg1" title="Algorithm 1 ‣ Appendix A Algorithm Summary ‣ GAPrune: Gradient-Alignment Pruning for Domain-Aware Embeddings" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> presents the complete GAPrune procedure, which operates through three sequential stages: (1) representative sampling to distill essential statistical properties from both general and domain-specific corpora, (2) comprehensive parameter analysis that computes Fisher information and gradient alignment scores for each parameter, and (3) unified importance scoring and pruning based on our proposed Domain-Aware Importance (DAI) metric.</p>
</div>
<figure id="alg1" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span> Gradient-Alignment Pruning (GAPrune)</figcaption>
<div id="alg1.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg1.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">1:</span>
            
            
          Pre-trained embedding model <math id="alg1.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{M}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{M}</annotation></semantics></math> with parameters <math id="alg1.l1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta\in\mathbb{R}^{d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta\in\mathbb{R}^{d}</annotation></semantics></math>, general corpus <math id="alg1.l1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}_{gen}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}_{gen}</annotation></semantics></math>, domain corpus <math id="alg1.l1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}_{dom}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}_{dom}</annotation></semantics></math>, target sparsity <math id="alg1.l1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s\in(0,1)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s\in(0,1)</annotation></semantics></math>, trade-off parameters <math id="alg1.l1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha,\beta,\gamma\geq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha,\beta,\gamma\geq 0</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">2:</span>
            
            
          Pruned model <math id="alg1.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{M}_{pruned}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{M}_{pruned}</annotation></semantics></math> with sparsity <math id="alg1.l2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>s</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">3:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg1.l3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Stage 1: Representative Sampling</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">4:</span>
            
            
          <math id="alg1.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{S}_{gen}\leftarrow\text{KMeansSample}(\mathcal{D}_{gen},k=5000)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>KMeansSample</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5000</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{S}_{gen}\leftarrow\text{KMeansSample}(\mathcal{D}_{gen},k=5000)</annotation></semantics></math> {Sample representative general data}

</div>
<div id="alg1.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">5:</span>
            
            
          <math id="alg1.l5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{S}_{dom}\leftarrow\text{KMeansSample}(\mathcal{D}_{dom},k=5000)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>KMeansSample</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5000</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{S}_{dom}\leftarrow\text{KMeansSample}(\mathcal{D}_{dom},k=5000)</annotation></semantics></math> {Sample representative domain data}

</div>
<div id="alg1.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">6:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg1.l6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Stage 2: Parameter Analysis</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">7:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg1.l7.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> each parameter <math id="alg1.l7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta_{j}\in\theta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta_{j}\in\theta</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l7.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">8:</span>
            
            
           Compute gradients: <math id="alg1.l8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="g^{gen}_{j}\leftarrow\nabla_{\theta_{j}}\mathcal{L}(\mathcal{M},\mathcal{S}_{gen})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>g</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">g^{gen}_{j}\leftarrow\nabla_{\theta_{j}}\mathcal{L}(\mathcal{M},\mathcal{S}_{gen})</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">9:</span>
            
            
           Compute gradients: <math id="alg1.l9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="g^{dom}_{j}\leftarrow\nabla_{\theta_{j}}\mathcal{L}(\mathcal{M},\mathcal{S}_{dom})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>g</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">g^{dom}_{j}\leftarrow\nabla_{\theta_{j}}\mathcal{L}(\mathcal{M},\mathcal{S}_{dom})</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">10:</span>
            
            
           Estimate Fisher info: <math id="alg1.l10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="F^{gen}_{jj}\leftarrow\frac{1}{|\mathcal{S}_{gen}|}\sum_{i}(g^{gen}_{j,i})^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0em">∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>g</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">F^{gen}_{jj}\leftarrow\frac{1}{|\mathcal{S}_{gen}|}\sum_{i}(g^{gen}_{j,i})^{2}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">11:</span>
            
            
           Estimate Fisher info: <math id="alg1.l11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="F^{dom}_{jj}\leftarrow\frac{1}{|\mathcal{S}_{dom}|}\sum_{i}(g^{dom}_{j,i})^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0em">∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>g</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">F^{dom}_{jj}\leftarrow\frac{1}{|\mathcal{S}_{dom}|}\sum_{i}(g^{dom}_{j,i})^{2}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l12" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">12:</span>
            
            
           Compute alignment: <math id="alg1.l12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s_{g,j}\leftarrow\frac{\langle g^{gen}_{j},g^{dom}_{j}\rangle}{\|g^{gen}_{j}\|\|g^{dom}_{j}\|+\varepsilon}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>g</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>g</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msubsup><mi>g</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msubsup><mi>g</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s_{g,j}\leftarrow\frac{\langle g^{gen}_{j},g^{dom}_{j}\rangle}{\|g^{gen}_{j}\|\|g^{dom}_{j}\|+\varepsilon}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l13" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">13:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg1.l13.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l13.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l14" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">14:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg1.l14.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Stage 3: DAI Scoring</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l15" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">15:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg1.l15.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> each parameter <math id="alg1.l15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta_{j}\in\theta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta_{j}\in\theta</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l15.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l16" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">16:</span>
            
            
           Compute magnitude: <math id="alg1.l16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="|\theta_{j}|\leftarrow|\theta_{j}|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|\theta_{j}|\leftarrow|\theta_{j}|</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l17" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">17:</span>
            
            
           Compute DAI score: <math id="alg1.l17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{DAI}_{j}\leftarrow\left((F^{dom}_{jj}-\beta\cdot F^{gen}_{jj})\cdot|\theta_{j}|+\gamma\cdot\sqrt{|\theta_{j}|}\right)\cdot(1+\alpha\cdot s_{g,j})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>DAI</mtext><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msqrt><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{DAI}_{j}\leftarrow\left((F^{dom}_{jj}-\beta\cdot F^{gen}_{jj})\cdot|\theta_{j}|+\gamma\cdot\sqrt{|\theta_{j}|}\right)\cdot(1+\alpha\cdot s_{g,j})</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l18" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">18:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg1.l18.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l18.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l19" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">19:</span>
            
            
          Sort parameters by DAI scores: <math id="alg1.l19.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{\theta_{(1)},\theta_{(2)},\ldots,\theta_{(d)}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{\theta_{(1)},\theta_{(2)},\ldots,\theta_{(d)}\}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l20" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">20:</span>
            
            
          Retain top <math id="alg1.l20.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(1-s)\cdot d" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(1-s)\cdot d</annotation></semantics></math> parameters: <math id="alg1.l20.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{M}_{pruned}\leftarrow\text{Mask}(\mathcal{M},\{\theta_{(1)},\ldots,\theta_{((1-s)\cdot d)}\})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>Mask</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{M}_{pruned}\leftarrow\text{Mask}(\mathcal{M},\{\theta_{(1)},\ldots,\theta_{((1-s)\cdot d)}\})</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l21" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">21:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg1.l21.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> <math id="alg1.l21.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{M}_{pruned}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{M}_{pruned}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
</div>
</figure>
<div id="A1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Computational Complexity</span>
The computation costs of GAPrune mainly come from the parameter analysis stage. Computing gradients and Fisher information requires one forward and backward pass over <math id="A1.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math> samples in each calibration set, resulting in <math id="A1.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="O(|\theta|\cdot N)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">O(|\theta|\cdot N)</annotation></semantics></math> complexity. The remaining operations, gradient alignment and DAI score computation, are simple element-wise vector operations with <math id="A1.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="O(|\theta|)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">O(|\theta|)</annotation></semantics></math> cost. This single-shot analysis makes GAPrune practical for large-scale models without iterative procedures or retraining.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Evaluation Instructions</h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This section provides the evaluation instructions for all tasks used in our experiments. Table <a href="#A2.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ Appendix B Evaluation Instructions ‣ GAPrune: Gradient-Alignment Pruning for Domain-Aware Embeddings" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a> shows the evaluation instructions for the 20 FinMTEB tasks used in our experiments. Table <a href="#A2.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ Appendix B Evaluation Instructions ‣ GAPrune: Gradient-Alignment Pruning for Domain-Aware Embeddings" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> shows the evaluation instructions for the 19 ChemTEB tasks used in our experiments.</p>
</div>
